Package: interactR
Type: Package
Title: Package for Feature Extraction from Social Interactions
Version: 0.0.1.0
Author: Irene Sophia Plank
Maintainer: Irene Sophia Plank <10planki@gmail.com>
Description: This package contains functions to extract multimodal and crossmodal features from social interactions. Data extracted from recordings of real-life conversations or collected in the virtual reality environment VERSE. 
